      "mergedPostDetails": "Hello! I wanna give my opinions on the new avatar marketplace. Personally, I feel like it's a bit cluttered and rushed even. Compared to all the other UI in the game, it feels way too compact and different from the other menu's. I also don't really like how when I click on avatars I'm immediately in the shop. I don't want to have to also click on \"my avatars\" to change. I think the idea of buying avatars in game is an amazing idea. I just think it needs a bit more work. Maybe even it's own section.",
